# No comments

Do not write comments in code (`//`, `/* */`, `#`, `<!-- -->`, JSDoc/docstrings, or inline annotations).

Prefer clear names and structure over explaining with comments. Do not add comments when editing existing files either—leave pre-existing comments alone unless the user asks to change them.

Only add comments when the user explicitly requests them in the chat.
